// Notes in the shell whether the document has changes that are not saved: it has when the changes counted now are not the ones counted when it was last saved or opened (wa_clean). An undo is a change too, so a document undone back to what was saved is still dirty.
cli_update_dirty(App cli_dirty_app) {
  int cli_dirty_flag = (import editor_typing_row)[1] != (import cli_state_list)[(import wa_s_mark)];
  cli_dirty_app.ui.shell.dirty = cli_dirty_flag;
} return void;
